<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" ?>
<Flow xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <apiVersion>67.0</apiVersion>
    <areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>false</areMetricsLoggedToDataCloud>
    <decisions>
        <name>Check_State</name>
        <label>승인 요청할 수 있는 출동인가</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Screen_Request</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>승인 요청 가능</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Already_Pending</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_WorkOrder.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>PendingApproval</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Screen_Pending</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>이미 승인 대기</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Not_Arrived</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Get_WorkOrder.Status</leftValueReference>
                <operator>NotEqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <stringValue>Arrived</stringValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Screen_NotArrived</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>도착 상태 아님</label>
        </rules>
        <rules>
            <name>Not_Needed</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>fxNeedsApproval</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Screen_NotNeeded</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>승인 불필요</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Is_Submitted</name>
        <label>제출되었는가</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnector>
            <targetReference>Rollback_Changes</targetReference>
        </defaultConnector>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>실패</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Submitted</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Call_Submit.isSubmitted</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Screen_Submitted</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>제출됨</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description
  >26-10-15 출동 빠른 작업 &quot;승인 요청&quot;(기사, 데스크톱): 승인이 필요한 이유(예외 무상 건수·청구 합계 vs ServiceSetting ApprovalAmount)를 보여 주고 사유(필수)·고객 동의(기준 초과 시 필수)·센터장 메모를 받아 WorkOrder_Sub_SubmitApproval 호출. 도착 상태가 아니거나 승인이 필요 없으면 안내만 by Edwin</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <description
    >고객 동의 입력은 기준 초과일 때만 보임 → 아니면 기존 값 유지</description>
        <name>fxConsent</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression
    >IF({!fxOverThreshold}, {!ConsentInput}, {!Get_WorkOrder.CustomerConsent__c})</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxNeedsApproval</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression
    >{!Get_WorkOrder.HasExceptionFree__c} || {!fxOverThreshold}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxOverThreshold</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>{!fxTotalCharge} &gt; {!fxThreshold}</expression>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <description
    >승인 프로세스 진입 조건과 같은 기준 (기준 금액 없으면 진입 조건의 숫자 500000)</description>
        <name>fxThreshold</name>
        <dataType>Currency</dataType>
        <expression>BLANKVALUE({!Get_Threshold.Value__c}, 500000)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <formulas>
        <name>fxTotalCharge</name>
        <dataType>Currency</dataType>
        <expression
    >BLANKVALUE({!Get_WorkOrder.fmTotalCharge__c}, 0)</expression>
        <scale>0</scale>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>출동 승인 요청 {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <isAdditionalPermissionRequiredToRun
  >true</isAdditionalPermissionRequiredToRun>
    <label>출동 승인 요청</label>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>BuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>CanvasMode</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>AUTO_LAYOUT_CANVAS</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processMetadataValues>
        <name>OriginBuilderType</name>
        <value>
            <stringValue>LightningFlowBuilder</stringValue>
        </value>
    </processMetadataValues>
    <processType>Flow</processType>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_Threshold</name>
        <label>승인 기준 금액 가져오기</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound
    >false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Check_State</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>DeveloperName</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <stringValue>ApprovalAmount</stringValue>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>ServiceSetting__mdt</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Value__c</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordLookups>
        <name>Get_WorkOrder</name>
        <label>출동 가져오기</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound
    >false</assignNullValuesIfNoRecordsFound>
        <connector>
            <targetReference>Get_Threshold</targetReference>
        </connector>
        <filterLogic>and</filterLogic>
        <filters>
            <field>Id</field>
            <operator>EqualTo</operator>
            <value>
                <elementReference>recordId</elementReference>
            </value>
        </filters>
        <getFirstRecordOnly>true</getFirstRecordOnly>
        <object>WorkOrder</object>
        <queriedFields>Id</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>WorkOrderNumber</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>Status</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>HasExceptionFree__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>ruExceptionFreeCount__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>fmTotalCharge__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>ApprovalRequestReason__c</queriedFields>
        <queriedFields>CustomerConsent__c</queriedFields>
        <storeOutputAutomatically>true</storeOutputAutomatically>
    </recordLookups>
    <recordRollbacks>
        <description
    >하위 Flow가 저장한 사유·고객 동의를 되돌림 (승인 제출 실패 시, 같은 트랜잭션)</description>
        <name>Rollback_Changes</name>
